From abe15de9e40daa5d5217d5bc391bd39cf98c01d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dqx-studio-airgap build <build@localhost>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:19:15 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Air-gap build: skip CREATE SCHEMA, compile out AI
 and contract import

- DQX_SCHEMAS_PREEXIST=1 makes SqlExecutor.execute_no_schema skip every
  CREATE SCHEMA IF NOT EXISTS (the deployer cannot create schemas).
- VITE_DQX_AI_DISABLED=1 hides the AI assistant, the AI generation cards and
  the LLM primary-key toggle (no Foundation Model APIs).
- VITE_DQX_CONTRACTS_DISABLED=1 hides the data-contract import tab (the
  [datacontract] extra is not vendored).
Unset, all three behave exactly like stock.

